<div>
  <img decoding="async" width="696" height="392" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/metawars.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="Metawars Concludes Raise With Reputable Supporters and Partners" loading="lazy" style="float:left; margin:0 15px 15px 0;" /></p> 
  
  <p>
    PRESS RELEASE. <span style="font-weight: 400;">MetaWars, an innovative, multiplayer strategy blockchain-based game, has successfully raised $2.3 million USD from its supporting investors. MetaWars has collaborated with various investors and partners to incorporate blockchain into the emerging gaming industry and revolutionize NFTs. </span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">The game has recently announced their exclusive NFT auction starting from October 21st. The auction will be ongoing until the date of their confirmed TGE, the 27th of October. The NFT auction offers participants a range of NFTs that provide advantageous benefits for players in-game from a minimum price of 0.2 BNB. To know more about MetaWars’ exclusive NFT auction event, visit </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">here</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">MetaWars, as mentioned, will be hosting their TGE on the </span><b>27th</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> of October in collaboration with three launchpads, Polylauncher, Red Kite and GameFi. Their utility token, $WARS, has a total supply of 1,500,000,000 and is required for an in-game token $GAM for staking, upgrades, trading and more on their NFT marketplace.</span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <b>Introducing MetaWars</b>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">MetaWars is a sci-fi strategy game set with a multi-layered, key tactical battlefield that enables players to monetize from the game. Users can customize their game experience by taking control of the game’s ecosystem. It is a highly-interactive, galactic exploration game that provides users the opportunity to discover universes, solve mysteries, and defend riches from adversaries. With MetaWars, every player can wager, play-to-earn, and obtain NFT collectibles by completing challenges, earning MetaWars’ tokens ($WARS) and in-game ($GAM) tokens.</span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <b>Investors and Partners</b>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">MetaWars has successfully raised a total of $2.3 million USD for funding. The company is supported by various investors, including ABV, Raptor Capital, CinchBlock, x21, CoinUnited.io, Double Peak, Magnus Capital, Everse Capital, Infinity Gainz, and IceTeaLabs. </span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">The company is also grateful for the endless support of various partners, such as BSC, PancakeSwap, and launchpads Polylauncher, Red Kite and GameFi.</span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">Metawars is also supported by content creator Mr. Beast. Mr. Beast is one of the top content creators in the industry amassing 70.3 million YouTube followers. This serves as an opportunity for MetaWars to be introduced to various communities and provides the company with strength and motivation to move forward in the <a class="wpil_keyword_link" href="https://technologymanias.com/category/news" title="crypto">crypto</a> industry.</span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">MetaWars plans to utilise the accumulated funds to enhance the game and further the development of the platform and reach new heights, providing users the opportunity to maximize the use of the platform. </span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">For more technological updates and important announcements, don’t forget to visit MetaWars’ social media platforms.</span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
     
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <b>About MetaWars</b>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">MetaWars is a play-to-earn next-generation blockchain-backed gaming experience. Explore and battle throughout the universe. Fight, trade, and earn robots, ships, and planetary terrain backed by NFT in-game items. The $WARS token will become the anchor of an entire universe up for grabs.</span>
  </p>
  
